\cf2 This document outlines the governance, security, and intellectual property rules for a software framework called "Harshal\'92s Systems" (formerly AGS++). It establishes that the system is strictly controlled by its creator, Harshal Priyavadan Patel, and requires human verification for all critical actions to prevent the software from acting autonomously. Additionally, it details a physical verification process using a hardcover book and a limited pool of 500 voting coins for governance, while strictly protecting the creator's intellectual property from corporate takeover.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

