\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Intellectual Property: The framework is the sole property of Harshal Priyavadan Patel. It is designed as a "Philosophical Fortress" where the software cannot function if separated from its creator.\cb1 \
\ls2\ilvl0
\f2 \cf3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1 \cf2 \cb3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Physical Governance: Authority over the system's direction is tied to the physical world through the purchase of a specific hardcover book, with influence limited to 500 voting coins.\cb1 \
