\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 What AGS+ Is\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 AGS+ is a layered system architecture for coordinated action under external legitimacy, designed to remain correct under scale, adversarial pressure, emergencies, and long time horizons. AGS+ is not a governance system, a controller, or a value selector. It is a structural constraint system that determines how action may occur once it is externally authorized, and how that action can always be stopped.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

