\'95	Emergencies normalize exceptional power,\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	Scale forces federation or cartel formation,\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 AGS+ solves these by making misuse structurally slow, visible, and interruptible, without relying on intent, trust, or policy enforcement.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 Core Principles (Non-Negotiable)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 AGS+ is built on six load-bearing principles:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 1.	External Legitimacy: All authority originates outside the system. It is NEVER inferred, cached, or synthesized internally.\
2.	Bounded Action: Every action is fossilizedly bounded by scope, distance, and time.\
3.	Mandatory Refusal: Any ambiguity, violation, or interruption halts action immediately.\
4.	Non-Migration of Authority: Authority does not transfer through delegation, rotation, specialization, or persistence.\
5.	Resolution > Coordination: Oversight and interruption always outpace coordination and execution.\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa360\partightenfactor0
\cf2 6.	Adversarial Durability: The system remains correct even under hostile interpretation or loss of institutional memory.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

