\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 Communication occurs across three layers:\
\pard\tx20\tx290\tx720\pardeftab720\li290\fi-290\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\ls59\ilvl0\cf2 \cb1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3.	}\cb3 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Local Emission \'96 what each node independently expresses\cb1 \
