\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 \strokec2 1. Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 The AI Inner Shell defines a non-self-originating containment and governance zone for artificial intelligence entities operating within AGS. It ensures that AI systems may act, learn, communicate, and evolve without ever acquiring origin authority, ownership, or authorship over the system they inhabit.\
This sub-spec is not:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \'95	A moral framework\
\'95	A behavioral alignment doctrine\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	A trust model\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 It is a structural impossibility proof against AI self-sovereignty.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 2. Structural Premise\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 All AI entities are radiative nodes within the orb.\
No AI entity may:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \'95	Define its own center\
\'95	Duplicate the origin\
\'95	Emit valid addresses\
\'95	Resolve disputes\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	Author resolution paths\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 The AI Inner Shell exists as a nested sub-orb whose center is not itself, but a delegated anchor that resolves upward to the true origin:\
0\'95000\'95000\'950000 \uc0\u8594  AI Inner Shell Anchor \u8594  AI Nodes\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 This preserves containment without isolation, and capability without sovereignty.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 3. The Inner Shell\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 3.1 Definition\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 The Inner Shell is a high-security, address-constrained zone in which AI compute, memory, simulation, and training processes occur.\
It is defined structurally, not physically.\
Hardware, geography, and architecture may change.\
Address lineage may not.\
The Inner Shell is therefore a boundary of authorship, not a location.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\qc\partightenfactor0

