\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 1. Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 This sub-spec defines the role, limits, and protections of human operators who interface between the Center, the AI Inner Shell, and the wider orb.\
Its goal is to enable mediation without creating shadow centers, delegated sovereignty, or authority drift.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 This is not a trust doctrine. It is a structural constraint on what humans are allowed to become while mediating power.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 2. Operator Classification\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Human operators are radiative stewards, not authorities.\
They are:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \'95	Address-bearing nodes\
\'95	Temporally bounded actors\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	Replaceable by design\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 They are not:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \'95	Resolution authorities\
\'95	Origin delegates\
\'95	Policy roots\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	Permanent custodians\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 No operator role is inheritable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 No operator role is sovereign.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 3. Structural Position\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

