\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 0. Purpose\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 This document defines a structural model for coordinated action under external legitimacy constraints. The model is designed to remain coherent when scaled, adversarially stressed, or conceptually atomized and rebuilt.\
The language in this document intentionally avoids cybernetic, biological, or command-oriented metaphors. Where geometric or physical analogies are used, they describe topology and routing properties only, not mechanisms or authority.\
\pard\tx288\tx408\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls97\ilvl0\cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1.	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Design Premise and Core Invariants\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 This model is designed to coordinate bounded action under conditions of scale, uncertainty, and adversarial pressure, while preserving accountability and interruptibility. \
The design assumes:\
\pard\tx360\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\ls98\ilvl0
\f7 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Scale amplifies risk rather than reducing it\
\ls98\ilvl0
\f7 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Coordination tends toward misuse unless structurally constrained\
\ls98\ilvl0
\f7 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Legitimacy originates externally and cannot be synthesized internally\
\pard\tx360\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls98\ilvl0
\f7 \cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}
\f1 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone Future readers and implementers may act in bad faith or under misaligned incentives\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 The following invariants are load-bearing. No interpretation, optimization, or implementation may violate them.\
\pard\tx288\tx408\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\ls99\ilvl0\cf2 \up0 \nosupersub \ulnone \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1.	}\up0 \nosupersub \ulnone External Legitimacy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
