\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 6. Adversarial Durability\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 The model MUST remain correct under hostile interpretation, long time horizons, and loss of institutional memory.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 2. Atomic Primitives and Conceptual Foundations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 This model is intentionally reducible. All structures described later MUST be reconstructible from the following primitives. If a concept cannot be rebuilt from these elements, it is non-essential and MUST not be load-bearing.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 2.1 Atomic Primitives\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 The system reduces to the following irreducible primitives:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 1.	Action \'97 Something occurs or is attempted\
2.	Scope \'97 Where and to whom an action applies\
3.	Time \'97 When an action applies and when it expires\
4.	Distance \'97 How far effects propagate\
5.	Legitimacy Reference \'97 External permission to act\
6.	Execution \'97 Carrying out an action\
7.	Observation \'97 Seeing what occurs\
8.	Interruption \'97 Stopping action\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 9.	Communication Path \'97 How signals move\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 All higher-level structures are compositions of these primitives.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 2.2 Derived Necessities\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 From the primitives, the following necessities emerge without naming or metaphor:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \'95	Bounded operational contexts are required to combine execution with scope, time, and legitimacy\
\'95	Multiple such contexts MUST coexist to handle scale and specialization\
\'95	Observation and interruption MUST be separable from execution\
\'95	Resolution of legitimacy and conflict MUST terminate at a canonical surface\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	Coordination MUST NEVER outrun interruption\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0
