\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 All major components of the system\'97bounded operational contexts, a resolution axis, proxies, inward routing dominance\'97re-emerge when the model is atomized and rebuilt from primitives. This is not a matter of design preference. It is a consequence of the constraints. Coherence arises from topology, not intent. Authority remains bounded because structure makes abuse slow and visible. The system endures because it is difficult to misuse without clearly violating its own invariants\
