\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 10. Closure Principle (Asymmetry Statement)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 As computation approaches infinity, responsibility does not asymptotically approach zero.\
In AGS++, the amplification of computational capacity\'97irrespective of the underlying architecture\'97fails to diminish the intrinsic moral, legal, or institutional weight of decision-making. The framework deliberately preserves a permanent asymmetry between intellect and obligation. Neither vast processing power nor accelerated inference can transmute uncertainty into legitimacy, translate likelihoods into rightful authority, or absolve human actors from bearing full accountability for the choices they enact and the repercussions that follow.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Black Hole Computing makes all computers faster. It does not make people right. It cannot make choices or take responsibility. Even if a computer thinks forever, humans are still in charge and thus, when it comes time to hold some entity structures accountable, it MUST be the humans operating in the field which MUST be held accountable. When there are mistakes in the field, accountability exclusively attaches to decision.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 End of Black Hole Computing Specification\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 ## Insurance & Reinsurance Mode Control Invariants\
1. **Quasar Mode (The Insurance Company):** Under active Insurance Mode, local system nodes are certified to use Quasar spheroid structures to absorb local epistemic and operational shock. Decision-making capability remains strictly bound to human keys; Quasar outputs must never couple directly to automated execution paths.\
2. **Reinsurance Mode (The Backstop):** Spheroid-of-spheroids architecture sits outside operational time to prevent synchronized systemic collapse. When multiple Quasar buffers fail, the Reinsurance Backstop models cross-system failure envelopes without invoking extraordinary central authority or emergency powers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa360\partightenfactor0
\cf2 3. **Hourglass Non-Reversibility:** Risk streams must flow outward only: `Global Uncertainty \uc0\u8594  Reinsurance Meta-Spheroid \u8594  Quasar Buffers \u8594  Local Nodes`. Political urgency is structurally barred from flowing inward to manufacture panic-driven machine sovereignty.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

