\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 Quasar Mode is not an intelligence body in the atomic sense. It is a spheroid body: A distributed, stabilizing structure whose purpose is to absorb uncertainty, price risk, and dampen shock across systems without exercising authority.\
