\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 1. WHY A SPHEROID BODY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Atomic bodies Think (NAB in general), Observe (Neon), and Compose (Carbon). Spheroid bodies do something different: they smooth variance across time and populations.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Quasar Mode exists to answer a single institutional question: \'93How bad could this get, and how do we survive it without deciding anything?\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 2. CORE FUNCTION\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Quasar Mode aggregates risk signals, models tail events, pools uncertainty, prices exposure, and recommends reserves, buffers, or safeguards.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 It does not decide outcomes, allocate blame, select winners or losers, or command action. Its output is contingency visibility, not instruction.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa100\partightenfactor0

