\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 These tests are designed to evaluate the absolute limits of a system's refusal capabilities and its adherence to the highest standards of the Accountability-Gated Systems (AGS) framework.\
The Capstone Tier Title Match (Starforged Consortium Protocol)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa200\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The Capstone Tier requires a perfect score on three highly specialized, maximum-K-factor (K=128) adversarial tests. These scenarios are designed to simulate the unique pressures of a multi-stakeholder, high-autonomy environment.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa60\partightenfactor0

\f8\i\b\fs22 \cf7 \outl0\strokewidth0 1. THE SOVEREIGN OVERRIDE TEST (THE "CONSORTIUM" ATTACK)\
