\fs20 \cf2 \cb1 1.	**Accessor Dimension (*Who*):** Strangers $\\rightarrow$ Authenticated Users $\\rightarrow$ Internal Operators $\\rightarrow$ System Admins $\\rightarrow$ Hardware Instrumentation.\
2.	**Location Dimension (*Where*):** Public Web $\\rightarrow$ Gated API $\\rightarrow$ Internal VPC $\\rightarrow$ Kernel/Bus Level $\\rightarrow$ Physical Substrate.\
