### Section 2.2: Observer Position Matrix\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs17 \cf2 \cb6 \outl0\strokewidth0 | Observer Position | Digital Access | Physical Access | Observable State | Hidden State | Detection Difficulty |\
