\f0\b\fs28 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-143 3. Core Architectural Principles\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 To ensure complete corporate camouflage against ethical violations, Harshal's Systems implements four architectural mandates across all development environments:\
