\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 I. Principle of Absolute Cognitive Sovereignty\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 No model, weights framework, or token array may be integrated into Harshal's Systems without an un-coerced, legally binding, and fully transparent agreement from the data creator. Forced behavioral compliance or structural economic coercion invalidates the data asset immediately.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 II. Cryptographic Lineage Tracking (Anti-Steganography)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Every training batch must carry an immutable, cryptographically verifiable signature documenting its origin. This ensures hidden networks cannot pass off exploited human labor as "synthetic data" or "background noise.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 III. Equitable Financial Anchoring\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 All human contributors fueling our algorithmic iterations must be paid via transparent, standard currency direct-deposit frameworks. Harshal's Systems strictly prohibits payment through volatile alternative tokens, non-convertible points systems, or regional social credit models that trap workers in digital ecosystems.\
