\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Progress at Harshal's Systems is measured not just by computational velocity or relative profit margins, but by the safety and absolute dignity of the human ecosystem powering our tools. By enforcing rigid, traceable data lineage and zero-compromise sourcing rules, we protect innocent contributors from systemic exploitation and build a platform that stands as a model of clean, ethical technological advancement.\
