\f1\i0\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 This section outlines a conceptual framework for establishing Proof-Of-Work, Continuity, and Accountability in Keyed Human\'96Machine Hybrid systems. The proven framework is intentionally conservative: it prioritizes traceability, verifiability, and containment over performance or autonomy. Proof-Of-Work is treated not as evidence of computational effort, but as evidence of sustained, attributable human\'96system coupling over time.\
