\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Time is a critical axis for accountability. Single authoritative clocks create fragile points of failure and ambiguity in post-hoc attribution. The system\'92s framework therefore assumes the use of multiple, independent temporal sources to establish temporal consistency rather than absolute universal correctness. The Author still uses Universal Timekeeping System w/LLANY Evolutions And Mutations, originally known Space Waves and Time Rivers.\
