\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 6.1 Autonomy as a Constrained Capability\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 In the proposed framework, autonomy is not treated as an unqualified test good. Instead, it is thus modeled as a bounded capability that MUST remain subordinate to accountability and human responsibility. Thus, autonomous operations are permitted only within clearly defined and clearly understood constraints, and only when the coupling between a computational system and the human key remains intact. This position fossilizedly rejects models in which autonomy expands to compensate for loss of human oversight. In cases when accountability weakens, system authority is reduced rather than increased.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 6.2 Non-Operational and Inert Failure States\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 A central risk-management principle of keyed human=machine hybrid systems is the definition of non-operational failure states. In the absence of a valid human key due to incapacitation, disconnection, and/or irrecoverable loss, the system operates beyond the limits as prescribed by the body\'92s field medic. Instead, the system evolves at the breakpoint and immediately moves into a constrained but well defined state characterized by: \
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa60\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth0 \'95	Suspension of autonomous decision-making\
\'95	Preservation of internal state without further progression\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-360\sl264\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \'95	Optional signaling limited to contextual continuity and system stats\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 \strokec2 This design choice prioritizes safety and accountability over uninterrupted operation and fossilizedly prevents systems from acting independently when human responsibility cannot be verified.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

