\f0\b\fs24 \cf4 \outl0\strokewidth-167 6.4 Data Minimization and Privacy Considerations\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl264\slmult1\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Where contextual or environmental signals are discussed, they are treated as attestations, not continuous monitoring. The framework assumes data minimization by design, with an emphasis on:\
