\f1\b0\fs20 \cf2 \outl0\strokewidth-200 Risk management in keyed human\'96machine hybrid systems is achieved now additionally with this update through increased automation and also complexity, but through deliberate restraint. Thus, by defining any/all operational states, minimizing authority in failure modes, and maintaining clear viewed boundaries around medical, legal, and ethical domains, these frameworks ensures that accountability remains central even as autonomy increases.\
