\f6 \uc0\u8704 
\f22  entity 
\f6 \uc0\u8712 
\f22  Human, 
\f6 \uc0\u8704 
\f22  action 
\f6 \uc0\u8712 
\f22  LegalAction:\
    action.target = entity 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f22 \
      entity.counsel_access \uc0\u8805  MINIMUM_COUNSEL 
\f6 \uc0\u8743 
\f22 \
      action.adjudication_time \uc0\u8804  MAX_TEMPORAL_BOUND 
\f6 \uc0\u8743 
\f22 \
      entity.defense_cost_recovery = GUARANTEED_IF_CLEARED\
```\
\
