## Executive Summary\
\
This specification addresses a distinct failure mode from ADJR: not legal weaponization against an individual, but **structural exclusion of cognitive laborers from credit, equity, and visibility in systems their labor directly shapes.**\
\
The failure pattern: workers are compensated for output but excluded from attribution, equity, and governance input \'97 even when their labor materially determines system behavior (model persona, safety responses, alignment characteristics). This is not resolved by higher pay alone. It requires structural attribution that survives vendor layering, risk-weighted credit, and non-erasable provenance.\
\
> **Axiom Zero \'97 The Provenance Invariant.** Cognitive labor that shapes a system's behavior generates a permanent, traceable claim on that system's provenance record. This claim cannot be severed by subcontracting, anonymization, or corporate restructuring.\
\
