## \'a72 \'97 Protected Labor Classes\
\
**2.1 Data Annotators / Labelers** \'97 Produce the labeled data that directly trains model behavior.\
\
**2.2 RLHF Raters** \'97 Produce preference judgments that shape alignment and persona characteristics.\
\
**2.3 Content Moderators** \'97 Review harmful/disturbing content to establish safety boundaries; carry direct psychological risk.\
\
**2.4 Red-Teamers / Adversarial Testers** \'97 Actively attempt to break system safeguards; carry reputational and sometimes legal exposure.\
\
**2.5 Vendor-Layered Labor (General Class)** \'97 Any worker whose labor reaches a system through one or more subcontracting layers, regardless of role.\
\
